					(reference "#FLG06")
					(unit 1)
				)
			)
		)
	)
	(text "J1 and J2 (centre pin positive) are in parallel: 12 V passes straight through to the next board.\nD1 blocks a reversed 12 V lead.  D4 clamps the +12V rail: D1 stops a decelerating motor\n   returning energy to the supply, so the rail can only rise; the electrolytics are 25 V.\n+12V feeds the four drivers through their own polyfuses F1-F4 (page 1).\nU7 (linear 7805, TO-220) makes +5V for the XIAO; a K7805-500R3 switching module fits the\n   same three holes.  D2 stops USB (the XIAO VBUS pin) back-feeding +5V.\nPWR_FLAG is not a part: it tells the rule check that a net is powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 64.77 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "931fa191-98ff-5f2e-9890-4b59461f6235")
	)
