		(property "Description" "Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32-S3 Plus, 23-pad castellated module. Pads 1-14 edge castellations, 15-23 small pads between them (numbering per Seeed XIAO-HALF-HOLE-23P). I/O pins follow the physical pad order along each edge."
