	(text "As on Node v2: Qwiic carries GND, SDA and SCL only.  JP1 (QWIIC_PWR) stays open, so the 3V3 wire of the\n   cables is not driven from here.  R1 / R2 are footprints only (not fitted): the pull-ups are on the Central.\nD3 runs from 3.3 V on purpose, as on Node v2: below the part's 3.5 V minimum, but it works there.\n   Move its VDD to +5V if a batch misbehaves.  SDA and SCL also have test pads (TP10, TP11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c823c6a-943b-53ff-b535-1b038a9c1188")
	)
