	(text "Select (A1 A0): 00 = ENC1, 01 = ENC2, 10 = ENC3, 11 = ENC4.\n   One encoder is always selected; step 00, 01, 11, 10.\nUnused half of U6: 2E high, 2A0 / 2A1 low, outputs open.\nR5 pulls up the shared data line; an encoder drives it only while\n   selected.  R6 limits the current if two ever drive at once\n   or a cable is plugged in live.\nENC_CLK and ENC_DO have test pads (TP13, TP14, box below)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 67.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
