	(text "Pin 1 +3V3, 2 GND, 3 CLK, 4 DO, 5 CSN.  Each socket has its own clock series resistor (Rn2) and its own 100n (Cn7).\n   DO is shared; CSn (from U6) picks the encoder that answers.  An axis with no encoder plugged in runs open loop."
